WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.938
We're used to thinking 
about giving

00:00:01.938 --> 00:00:04.607
as&nbsp;something 
we should do.

00:00:04.607 --> 00:00:06.406
And it is.

00:00:06.406 --> 00:00:09.035
But in thinking 
about it this way,

00:00:09.035 --> 00:00:10.990
we're missing&nbsp;out 
on one of the

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:13.367
best parts of being human:

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:17.870
that we have evolved to
 find joy in helping&nbsp;others.

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:20.000
Let's stop thinking 
about giving

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.781
as just this moral 
obligation

00:00:22.781 --> 00:00:26.700
and start&nbsp;thinking of it
as a source of pleasure.

